                  "page_end": 3,
                  "page_start": 3,
                  "paraphrased": false,
                  "text_excerpt": "These results demonstrate that hash oligos stably label nuclei in a manner that is compatible with sci-RNA-seq."
                },
                "statement": "Nuclear hashing with unmodified ssDNA oligos stably labels nuclei and enables sample multiplexing in sci-RNA-seq."
              },
