                  "page_end": 3,
                  "page_start": 3,
                  "paraphrased": false,
                  "text_excerpt": "Hash oligos facilitated the identification of the vast majority of interspecies doublets (95.5%) and otherwise undetectable within-species doublets"
                },
                "statement": "Hash oligo labeling enables detection of doublets, including within-species doublets, with high sensitivity."
              }
